From: Surface RT bring-up
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] grate: implement initial base-level 2D texture sampling

Bind fragment sampler states and referenced views, emit linear texture
addresses/descriptors, and compile TEX with interpolated coordinates and
packed sample conversion. Keep sampler-only storage tightly packed because
the texture engine derives stride from width. Initial path: direct varying
2D coordinates, base level only, no general texture register allocation.

